 {
  "id": "textbook-fltrp-g2a-u5-2",
  "level": 5,
  "unit": 10,
  "book": "二年级上册",
  "bookOrder": 21,
  "group": "Unit 5 Festival",
  "groupZh": "第五单元 节日",
  "title": "A happy festival",
  "titleZh": "快乐的节日",
  "lines": [
   {
    "en": "Welcome, Joe.",
    "zh": "欢迎你，乔。"
   },
   {
    "en": "Hi, Lanlan. How do you celebrate the Spring Festival?",
    "zh": "你好，兰兰。你们怎么过春节？"
   },
   {
    "en": "We wear red clothes for the festival.",
    "zh": "过节时我们穿红衣服。"
   },
   {
    "en": "Look here. What is this?",
    "zh": "看这里。这是什么？"
   },
   {
    "en": "It's fu. It means good luck. We put it on the door.",
    "zh": "这是“福”，意思是好运。我们把它贴在门上。"
   },
   {
    "en": "Look at these red lanterns.",
    "zh": "看这些红灯笼。"
   },
   {
    "en": "They are beautiful!",
    "zh": "它们真漂亮！"
   },
   {
    "en": "We also put red paper-cuts on the windows.",
    "zh": "我们还在窗户上贴红色的剪纸。"
   },
   {
    "en": "Wow. They are great!",
    "zh": "哇，它们真棒！"
   },
   {
    "en": "Joe, come and have some jiaozi.",
    "zh": "乔，来吃点饺子吧。"
   },
   {
    "en": "Oh. What is this? A red candy.",
    "zh": "哦，这是什么？一颗红色的糖。"
   },
   {
    "en": "It's lucky jiaozi. It means good luck for the new year!",
    "zh": "这是幸运饺子，代表新的一年好运连连！"
   },
   {
    "en": "I like the Spring Festival. It's so interesting.",
    "zh": "我喜欢春节，它太有意思了。"
   }
  ],
